### SimpleWebRenderer

#### renders HTML through the canonical browser engine to RenderScene

- Verify: renders HTML through the canonical browser engine to RenderScene
   - Expected: scene.width equals `120)  # oracle: 120 — named expected value from the requirement`
   - Expected: scene.height equals `80)  # oracle: 80 — named expected value from the requirement`


